msgid "Unable to initialize the gPhoto2 libraries."
msgstr "Imposible a iniciación das librerias de gPhoto2."

#: kamera.cpp:117
msgid "Click this button to add a new camera."
msgstr "Prema este botón para añadir unha nova cámara."

#: kamera.cpp:120
msgid "Test"
msgstr "Probar"

#: kamera.cpp:121 kamera.cpp:124
msgid "Click this button to remove the selected camera from the list."
msgstr "Prema este botón para borrar a cámara seleccionada dende a lista."

#: kamera.cpp:126
msgid "Configure..."
msgstr "Configurar..."

#: kamera.cpp:127
msgid ""
"Click this button to change the configuration of the selected camera."
"<br><br>The availability of this feature and the contents of the "
"Configuration dialog depend on the camera model."
msgstr ""
"Prema este botón para cambiar a configuración dá cámera seleccionada."
"<br><br>As caracteristicas e os contidos dá "
"Configuración dependen dó modelo da cámara."

#: kamera.cpp:130
msgid ""
"Click this button to view a summary of the current status of the selected "
"camera.<br><br>The availability of this feature and the contents of the "
"Configuration dialog depend on the camera model."
msgstr ""
"Prema para ollar o sumario do estado actual da cámara "
"seleccionada.<br><br>As caracteristicas e os contidos da "
"Configuración dependen do modelo da cámara."

#: kamera.cpp:134
msgid "Click this button to cancel the current camera operation."
msgstr "Prema este botón para cancelar a operación coa cámara actual."

#: kamera.cpp:297
msgid "Camera test was successful."
msgstr "Proba da cámara superada con éxito."

#: kamera.cpp:379
msgid ""
"<h1>Kamera Configuration</h1>\n"
"This module allows you to configure support for your digital camera.\n"
"You would need to select the camera's model and the port it is connected\n"
"to on your computer (e.g. USB, Serial, Firewire). If your camera doesn't\n"
"appear in the list of <i>Supported Cameras</i>, go to the\n"
"<a href=\"http://www.gphoto.org\">GPhoto web site</a> for a possible update."
"<br><br>\n"
"To view and download images from the digital camera, go to address\n"
"<a href=\"camera:/\">camera:/</a> in Konqueror and other KDE applications."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Configuración Kamera</h1>\n"
"O módule permite a configuración da cámara dixital soportada.\n"
"Pode necesitar seleccionar o modelo de cámara e o porto onde este conectada\n"
"na sua computadora (e.x USB, Serie, Firewire). Se a sua cámara non\n"
"aparece na lista de <i>Cámaras soportadas</i>, vaia a  o\n"
"<a href=\"http://www.gphoto.org\"> sitio Web GPhoto</a> para posibles actualizacións."
"<br><br>\n"
"Olle e descargue imaxes dende a sua cámara dixital, o enderezo\n"
"<a href=\"camara:/\">camara:/</a> no Konqueror e outras aplicacións KDE."

#: kameradevice.cpp:53
msgid "Could not allocate memory for abilities list."
msgstr "Non se pode asignar memoria para habilitar a lista."

#: kameradevice.cpp:57
msgid "Could not load ability list."
msgstr "Non se pode cargar o listado."

#: kameradevice.cpp:62 kameradevice.cpp:403 kameradevice.cpp:423
msgid ""
"Description of abilities for camera %1 is not available. Configuration "
"options may be incorrect."
msgstr ""
"A descripción das capacidades da cámara %1 non son correctas.Configuración "
"e opcións poden ser incorrectas."

#: kameradevice.cpp:85
msgid "Could not access driver. Check your gPhoto2 installation."
msgstr "Non se pode acceder ó controlador. Comprobe a instalación de gPhoto2."

#: kameradevice.cpp:105
msgid ""
"Unable to initialize camera. Check your port settings and camera "
"connectivity and try again."
msgstr ""
"Imposible a iniciación da cámara. Comprobe a cofiguración e conexión do porto e da cámara "
"e intenteo de novo."

#: kameradevice.cpp:129
msgid "No camera summary information is available.\n"
msgstr "A información da Cámara non é válida.\n"

